      <cyrillic>тогших</cyrillic>
      <transcript>TOΓSI-</transcript>
      <definition>1 [= tongsi-] v.t. and i. To knock, rap, beat; to throb; to peck.</definition>
      <page>814</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠡᠭᠦᠳᠡᠨ ᠢ ᠲᠣᠬᠰᠢᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>egyden i --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To knock at the door.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠵᠢᠷᠦᠺᠡ ᠲᠣᠬᠰᠢᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>ziryke --xu</transcript>
          <definition> The heart beats.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
